#: game.cpp:686
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You have changed the size setting of the game and that requires a new game "
"to start.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to abandon the current game or continue playing and restore the "
"previous size setting?"
msgstr "Promijenili ste postavku veličine ploče, zbog čega treba pokrenuti novu igru.\n"
"\n"
"Želite li napustiti trenutačnu igru ili nastaviti igrati i vratiti prethodnu veličinu?"

#: game.cpp:692
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You have requested a new game, but there is already a game in progress.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to abandon the current game?"
msgstr "Zatražili ste novu igru, ali igra je već u tijeku.\n"
"\n"
"Želite li napustiti trenutačnu igru?"

